romdev-splat
============

This package is a JavaScript port of splat, the binary splitting tool used by
N64/PS1 decompilation projects, made for romdev. Its output (assembly files,
linker scripts, dependency files, undefined symbol files, binary and image
assets, C stubs, symbol dumps) is byte-identical to Python splat's for the
same inputs. It is licensed under the MIT License (see LICENSE).

Components and attribution
--------------------------

1. splat
   https://github.com/ethteck/splat
   Ported from splat64 0.37.1 (PyPI sdist / tag v0.37.1), with the behaviour
   of splat64 0.34.1 reproduced behind a version option.
   Copyright (c) 2021 Ethan Roseman and the splat contributors.
   Licensed under the MIT License (LICENSE).
   src/**/*.js are module-by-module translations of splat/**/*.py
   (scripts/split.py, util/, segtypes/, disassembler/, platforms/).

2. n64img
   https://github.com/decompals/n64img
   src/n64img/image.js is a translation of n64img 0.3.3 (image.py, iter.py).
   Copyright (c) 2022 Decompals. MIT License (LICENSE).

3. pypng
   https://gitlab.com/drj11/pypng
   src/n64img/png.js translates the Writer code paths of png.py
   (pypng 0.20220715.0) that n64img uses.
   Copyright (C) 2006 Johann C. Rocholl, portions (C) 2009 David Jones,
   (C) 2006 Nicko van Someren. MIT License (LICENSE).

4. zlib
   https://zlib.net
   src/wasm/zlib-stream.wasm is vanilla zlib (emscripten's zlib port,
   emsdk 4.0.18: zlib 1.3.1) with a small stream API
   (packages/romdevtools/scripts/src/zlib-stream.c in the romdev repository,
   built by scripts/build-zlib-wasm.sh). zlib License (LICENSE).

5. Project extension segtypes
   src/ext/index.js contains JS translations of splat extension segtypes
   (extensions_path/*.py) shipped by specific decompilation projects, each
   identified by the sha256 of its Python source.

Not contained in this package: the disassembler (romdev-spimdisasm, a port
of spimdisasm, and romdev-rabbitizer), loaded at run time.
